  <div class="sub">Week 2 · Day 4 — Price-Comparison Research Begins</div>
</header>

<div class="timestrip">
  <div class="ts-login">0:00–8:00<br>Login + Typing</div>
  <div class="ts-review">8:00–11:00<br>Choral Recall</div>
