</table>

<div class="identity">
  <h3>You're Already Thinking Like a Consumer and a Business Owner</h3>
  <p><span class="cap">Important names are capitalized</span> — and you are an important person. Every time you compare prices before you buy something, you're already doing the exact reasoning a business owner does when they set their own prices. Tomorrow you finish the research and write it up.</p>
